# Offline deployment bundle artifacts.
#
# The offline bundle for the ARM64 / Kunpeng 920 setup ships Ubuntu kernel
# header .deb packages and a source tarball that are only useful when
# transferring to an air-gapped machine, and are far too large for the
# repository.  Fetch them from the Ubuntu archive instead; the build and
# diagnose scripts plus the instructions are tracked.
/offline-arm64/debs/
/offline-arm64/src/
/offline-arm64.zip

# Kernel build output
*.o
*.ko
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.symvers
*.order
.*.cmd
.tmp_versions/
*.tmp

# Editor / OS noise
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store
